## 11. Technical Architecture

### 11.1 Integration Points

```
┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐
│  POS Service │────▶│ Credit       │────▶│ GroSupply    │
│              │     │ Service      │     │ Service      │
└──────────────┘     └──────────────┘     └──────────────┘
       │                    │                    │
       ▼                    ▼                    ▼
┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────┐
│  Inventory   │     │  Accounting  │     │   Payment    │
│  Service     │     │  Service     │     │   Gateway    │
└──────────────┘     └──────────────┘     └──────────────┘
```

### 11.2 Nightly Score Calculation

1. Aggregate sales data from POS Service
2. Pull inventory metrics from Inventory Service
3. Fetch supplier data from GroSupply Service
4. Calculate weighted scores
5. Update credit limits if needed
6. Generate alerts for significant changes

